      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4321867144667565241, guid: 95ff96ee75b21474288df607ce3f900b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Lumiphore is a type of snail that contains fluorescent material, causing
        it to emit a greenish glow. This subspecies often gathers in small flocks
        where it synchronizes its glow based on the light it consumes. \n\nOur guests
        are very important, but most importantly, their case is not typical. According
        to the owner, they have stopped glowing in sync and lost their balance. They
        need to be re-energized so they can glow at the same time. This order is
        very important and will especially affect your reputation.\n\r\nHere's what
        you'll need:\r\n1. The water in the cauldron must be extremely cold.\r\n2.
        On the synthesis table, create two elements: balance and energy. You also
        need a firefly and soul remains\r\n3. Mix everything in the cauldron to obtain
        ether."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9171242996182250256, guid: 95ff96ee75b21474288df607ce3f900b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_StaticEditorFlags
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
